{"a":[28,28],"h":"<p><svg class=\"ea\" width=\"165\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 164.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 23.3 30.0 36.7 57.7 57.7 66.7 66.7 75.0 75.0 81.7 81.7 114.7 126.7 126.7 135.0 141.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 36.7 97.6 97.6 114.7 135.0 141.7 148.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bunun üzerine onlardan içine bir korku düştü - « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"267\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 266.5 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 12.0 12.0 21.0 28.4 28.4 40.4 56.2 56.2 63.0 63.0 69.7 77.2 77.2 84.0 93.0 93.0 103.4 103.4 117.7 133.4 154.4 154.4 163.4 163.4 171.7 178.4 178.4 187.4 187.4 194.2 210.0 210.0 210.0 216.7 234.0 240.7 240.7 249.7 256.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"21.0 40.4 69.7 117.7 138.0 171.7 194.2 216.7 240.7 249.7 256.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » yemeğe el uzatmadıklarını görünce işkillendi, zira yemeğini yememek azçok husumet ve infiale delâlet eden bir ma'nâdan halî kalmaz. İbni Abbastan mervî olduğuna göre Melâike olduklarını sezdi, azâb için gelmiş olmaları ihtimali hatırına gelerek korktu<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"268\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 267.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 32.3 32.3 39.0 57.0 57.0 63.8 75.8 75.8 82.6 82.6 98.3 98.3 105.0 113.3 113.3 120.8 120.8 132.8 139.6 156.8 156.8 156.8 174.8 187.6 194.3 215.3 222.0 230.3 230.3 237.8 244.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.